[{"client_msg_id":"34460dd9-5cc8-4fdc-ad28-ae8d929d986e","type":"message","user":"U01ATUT6PL3","text":"`match` はインデントが2階層増えるので、 `if let` が使えるときはそちらを使います","ts":"1618928414.073900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Q0YS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5c887026-188d-42c6-b833-e789d88e3f9f","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"たしかに match 式のほうがパターンマッチとしてはわかりやすいし、ほかの構文との混同も無い気もしますね。だんだん私も if let に対する愛が揺らいできたぞ","ts":"1618899496.072900","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["U7B4ZD49X"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"hcN7q"}]},{"client_msg_id":"09fbba90-3d3f-4dd0-b464-93eaeec7e790","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"やっぱり `let A = if ... {` と `if let A = ... {` が紛らわしいのだけはなんとかなりたいけれど。。。","ts":"1618899366.072800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"HfXyf"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cda83f80-c5db-4871-b688-13c14b12dd7c","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"そういうケースに遭遇して `_ =\u0026gt; {}` って書いた時に `if let` を愛せるかもしれない。","ts":"1618899155.071900","edited":{"user":"U8R597E9H","ts":"1618899163.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"yjz40"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6a08ce14-d747-4a1e-825a-588f03dc7d5f","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"あー、むしろ網羅したくないんや！ってケースに使うのか。","ts":"1618899119.071200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"p=D/D"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1a04e25d-6203-4b1d-89e2-8c528e4a1450","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"if let でできることは大概 match でもできるはずですが、 match だと仰々しいなあ…ってときに if let、という感じで私は使ってますね。「このバリアントかどうかだけ確かめたいんや」みたいな。match で\n\n_ =\u0026gt; {}\n\nみたいなアーム書くのちょっともにょりませんか？「いや何もせんのかーい」的な。","ts":"1618898666.070700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"S1Jn"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7598fc02-bfb5-44a2-97f8-a0cbbb5f6d34","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"`if let ...` はこういうケースでハマる！みたいなのもよくわからないんですよね。たいてい match でいいような。","ts":"1618898489.070600","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["U7B4ZD49X"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Fxg"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bbf1f82f-e31c-4495-aefd-f1599838f476","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"`if a.is_none()` わかるｗ","ts":"1618898411.069600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"h1k"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f2d88305-3ca8-47a7-b6e8-8a3e26a15637","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"if a == b と if let a = b を間違えて書いちゃって LSP に怒られるのは私もよくやります。\nあと if let None = a {...} って書いたら「それ if a.is_none() で良くね？」って言われたりとか。","ts":"1618898360.069200","edited":{"user":"UL6CFN8NR","ts":"1618898374.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8T1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"39c7beef-a373-40b7-a941-d5eb6f9b136e","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"後者はできれば match を使いたいなあ。くらいのお気持ち。","ts":"1618898229.069100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"PUC0X"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b367d0a3-e2ab-47e8-96d3-028e41560b25","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"なんというか、`let A = if ...` と `if let A = ... {}` が行が変わるごとに出てきたり出てこなかったりするというのが辛いポイントなのかもしれませんｗ","ts":"1618898185.068400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"rRqt"}]},{"client_msg_id":"681a5a6b-3019-4330-80df-5e9370fb61ac","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"Rustの let はパターンマッチなんですよね。\nなので、 if let は「もしこのパターンに当てはまったら…」ということなので私は意味の取りやすい構文だなあと感じます。 while let とかも","ts":"1618895742.067300","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":4,"users":["U03C71D7H","U01BY3SDBRS","U776661HA","ULPLDSYV8"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"n4e"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e59c5d8b-6af8-4b11-b7e8-b11981ba6519","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"if let でうっってなるのなんとなくわかる気がします。。。","ts":"1618891195.066700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"GmPqd"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8d55d830-16c1-4575-989c-670f21092a8d","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"clippy さんが怒るから使ったりします","ts":"1618889773.065600","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":3,"users":["U7B4ZD49X","U01TQP86UM6","U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vET"}]},{"client_msg_id":"698cc477-6cf0-4060-a193-669fe789fc48","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"なんかこいつだけ読み取るの難しく感じてしまう・・・","ts":"1618889463.065300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"lf+g"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1be7fb04-2775-4e61-b9ac-ef106bf94688","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"個人的には既存の構文では `if let` をあんまり使わない","ts":"1618889431.064900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"k1yaE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7bf6c5d6-e858-409f-b5a8-b2d5da7df645","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"一瞬で「あ、`foo` 欲しいのね」で読み飛ばせるのが超便利","ts":"1618889386.064100","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":5,"users":["U7B4ZD49X","U01TQP86UM6","U01BY3SDBRS","U9S4G0LJW","UL6CFN8NR"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"CjQGI"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0c33da97-f33e-43ab-b7d2-89dfe98d77e1","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"これわかるな","ts":"1618889360.063400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"D0xsH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f0eed467-0ed4-40e3-a2d9-5b5e10b1383b","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"```let foo = {\n  let a = ...;\n  let b = ...;\n  let c = ...;\n  make_foo(a, b, c)\n};```\nってやつ","ts":"1618889321.062600","edited":{"user":"U776661HA","ts":"1618889334.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"UCg6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"45ef44c0-2fa8-44f9-9c6e-6da3acf38533","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"Rust は `{}` が式になるのがとても便利。`foo` 作るのに一次変数 `a, b, c` が必要とかいう場合も、生存期間がとてもわかりやすく書ける","ts":"1618889285.061800","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["UL6CFN8NR"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"kOACB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9dcf3830-fbc8-435a-9195-7acc201df1f4","type":"message","user":"U01TQP86UM6","text":"三項演算子のつもりでif書くとrustfmtが5行ぐらいに展開することがあり\n4行程度で済んでインデントもいい感じなmatchを使いがちになる","ts":"1618889111.060900","edited":{"user":"U01TQP86UM6","ts":"1618889129.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"EZy"}]},{"client_msg_id":"43064c9e-f96c-4fc1-ab0d-3262245aa011","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"Lisp","ts":"1618888892.060600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"gaA8"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ce397ec3-d069-4033-b5d2-ea38e713cab4","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"式指向に慣れると文なんて飾りでは？ってなる","ts":"1618884886.060200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"VkB3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b9866f3d-5d22-4f3b-8093-e6ef1208b60f","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"まぁでもif式はめちゃくちゃほしいですね・・・","ts":"1618884375.060100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"nGG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8374d4dc-e6da-474e-9780-b857a4ab6cd5","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"forで再代入するとか","ts":"1618884324.059800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cVZZU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c587301a-fa98-423f-91c9-ed45aba879b2","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"最近諦めてTSはlet書きがちになりつつある","ts":"1618884307.059400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"aWV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7e78d60e-4e1c-4bfa-899e-1c8d95535626","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"TS で 絶対 const 使うでござるをしてると三項演算子書きがちになるので、そういうとき 式だと便利だろうなーと思います","ts":"1618884276.059100","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":2,"users":["U01BY3SDBRS","U776661HA"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xyb"}]},{"client_msg_id":"B3192DD0-61E2-4EDB-9899-B120B942C995","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"式指向の言語めっちゃ好き。OCamlとかもifは式です。\n関数型言語にとっては if は式じゃないと色々辛いのでしょうね。","ts":"1618883524.057700","edited":{"user":"UL6CFN8NR","ts":"1618883543.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"LgK1n"}]},{"client_msg_id":"A650992F-310B-4693-B416-0884ECEE99D2","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"全てが式は超便利ですねー","ts":"1618883261.055300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"p4Q6E"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c5b82bcc-7e04-43f8-921a-9ce0741a66e4","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"```let formal = true;\nlet greeting = if formal {\n    \"Good evening.\"\n} else {\n    \"Hello, friend!\"\n};\nprintln!(greeting) // prints \"Good evening.\"```\n意外と便利かも","ts":"1618874657.054800","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"benri","count":3,"users":["UDPT2BZ6E","U01BY3SDBRS","U01ATUT6PL3"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"rZdV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9ef00111-23ca-42a8-9f97-ddd240d4d114","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"MSのやつやってたけど、Rustってif文式として扱えるのか","ts":"1618874622.054100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Hlgkw"}]}]
